Syllogimous RR is an adaptation of "Syllogimous v3" by 4skinskywalker
(https://github.com/4skinskywalker/Syllogimous-v3), used under the
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 3.0 Unported licence (CC BY-NC 3.0).

Changes: the application has been rewritten (bug fixes, new question engine,
new interface, accessibility, adaptive training, explanations, statistics,
check-ups and translations into German, French, Italian, Spanish and Russian).
This adaptation is not endorsed by the original author.

